  "@type": "SemioticProjection",
  "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
  "label": "User projected onto the scene of the primal reaction",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the visual scene of the Black woman's exaggerated, primal reaction, which is juxtaposed with the text about asking a stroke patient to smile. The meme implies that the user (or the viewer) is imagining themselves in the position of asking the stroke patient, and the resulting reaction is the grotesque, animalistic expression shown. This projection is part of the shock humor trope, where the viewer is invited to imagine the absurd or shocking outcome, thereby internalizing the stereotype.",
